--- !u!114 &840190771
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 840190767}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a748b3f975d66464ba8b70ce7b445751, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogA:
  - Wait, Who's there?
  - Are you a traveller who followed the wrong path...
  - Hello, My name is Maya and i'm the only villager left here as everyone else evacuated
    because of the Snowstorm.
  - But now some bandits who call themselves the Angels took over the village and
    took all my ration..
  - Could you help me perhaps, I could teach you some ancient fight moves you know..
  - But I must first know your worth.
  - If you follow this path, you will reach a 4 road junction and dont you dare go
    straight as it leads to the Angels.
  - So, Instead go either top or bottom and you will find yourself near grass regions.
  - Be Aware there are nasty mobs out there and if you can slay atleast 5 of them,
    I could teach you some moves..
  dialogB:
